---
title: "Endless kitchen"
note: "A dinner service that never ends. Every clip, the next ticket ($station) sends the camera to the grill, the pastry bench or the wok, where a dish from that station is cooked; one time in ten a pan catches fire, the kitchen puts it out, and the service rolls on. The head chef ($chef, from __characters/average_joes__) runs the pass all night. GOTO lines steer it; the dishes come with the preset (@lib). Run (Instant) plays it until you stop."
tags: [loops, h3, reel, goto, motion_context]
---
@h3 t2va 16:9
context: 22
style: live-action, restaurant kitchen documentary, warm tungsten light, handheld, one continuous take
$chef = __characters/average_joes__
MUSIC: a fast brushed jazz drum at a low volume

@lib kitchen_grill
  a thick steak seared on a roaring grill
  skewers of vegetables charring over the coals
  a whole fish crisping skin-side down
@lib kitchen_dessert
  a tower of choux buns glazed with caramel
  a lemon tart torched until its top blisters
  a chocolate fondant turned out onto a white plate
@lib kitchen_wok
  noodles tossed through a burst of flame in a wok
  prawns flung into a smoking wok with chilli and garlic
  fried rice thrown high and caught again in the wok

CHUNK the pass
$station = {grill|pastry|wok}
SHOT 6s: tracking
Evening service begins. $chef tears the first ticket from the printer at the pass and calls it out to the kitchen.
SFX: a ticket printer chattering; pans clanging; the chef's shout
HANDOFF: a cook spins toward the $station station
? $station[grill]: GOTO: the grill
? $station[pastry]: GOTO: the pastry bench
GOTO: the wok

CHUNK the grill
$dish = __kitchen_grill__
$station = {grill|pastry|wok}
$fire = {10% fire}
SHOT 6s: push in
At the grill, a cook works on $dish, sweat on their brow, then plates it in one swift motion.
SFX: fat sizzling; tongs clacking; the extractor roaring
HANDOFF: the plate slides onto the pass as the next ticket prints
? $fire[fire]: GOTO: the fire
? $station[grill]: GOTO: the grill
? $station[pastry]: GOTO: the pastry bench
GOTO: the wok

CHUNK the pastry bench
$dish = __kitchen_dessert__
$station = {grill|pastry|wok}
$fire = {10% fire}
SHOT 6s: push in, slow
At the cool marble pastry bench, a cook finishes $dish with steady hands and a pair of tweezers.
SFX: a whisk on steel; a blowtorch's soft roar; quiet concentration
HANDOFF: the plate slides onto the pass as the next ticket prints
? $fire[fire]: GOTO: the fire
? $station[grill]: GOTO: the grill
? $station[pastry]: GOTO: the pastry bench
GOTO: the wok

CHUNK the wok
$dish = __kitchen_wok__
$station = {grill|pastry|wok}
$fire = {10% fire}
SHOT 6s: push in
At the wok station, a cook makes $dish, the flame leaping up with every toss.
SFX: a jet burner roaring; the wok scraping on its ring; sizzling
HANDOFF: the plate slides onto the pass as the next ticket prints
? $fire[fire]: GOTO: the fire
? $station[grill]: GOTO: the grill
? $station[pastry]: GOTO: the pastry bench
GOTO: the wok

CHUNK the fire
$station = {grill|pastry|wok}
SHOT 6s: shake slightly
A pan bursts into tall flames. A cook slams a lid onto it, the fire dies with a hiss, the whole kitchen cheers, and $chef calls the next order without missing a beat.
SFX: a whoosh of fire; a lid clanging down; cheering and laughter
HANDOFF: a cook spins toward the $station station
? $station[grill]: GOTO: the grill
? $station[pastry]: GOTO: the pastry bench
GOTO: the wok
